Agent Browser skill

Install:
  Install the missing Agent Browser skill and CLI; set up Chromium when installing the CLI.

Upgrade:
  Update the installed skill and CLI; refresh Chromium with the CLI.

Status:
  Report local skill files and CLI version; Chromium readiness is not verified.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Browser setup runs with CLI installation and upgrade.
  To repair browser files for an existing CLI, run agent-browser install.
  Source: https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/agent-browser
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/agent-browser becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
